{"id":"b64817ebaa67616c","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-comb5-regressive-map.md","title":"ZFC Comb5 Regressive Map","display":"df-zfc-comb5-regressive-map — ZFC Comb5 Regressive Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb5-regressive-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb5-regressive-map"],"display":"df-zfc-comb5-regressive-map — ZFC Comb5 Regressive Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb5-regressive-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-regressive-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb5-regressive-map — ZFC Comb5 Regressive Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md\">../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,S,f\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,S,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regressive}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Regressive}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md\">../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5RegressiveMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb5RegressiveMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}regressive\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5RegressiveMap}_S(\\kappa,S,f)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land \\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}regressive\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5RegressiveMap}_S(\\kappa,S,f)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land \\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Since <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is an ordinal, the reused predicate gives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\">\\(f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> at every nonzero <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in S\">\\(\\alpha\\in S\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Regressive}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,S,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Regressive}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5RegressiveMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}regressive\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5RegressiveMap}_S(\\kappa,S,f)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land \\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)","display":true},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\alpha)<\\alpha<\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in S","display":false}],"bytes":1085,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1659","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb5-regressive-map.md|58-df-zfc-comb5-regressive-map]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","5582a281f15a33c2"]}